{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-7013851","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【创作】2010年巴黎与闪耀洞窟","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一回忆巴黎地下墓穴之旅，讲述这段恐惧又震撼的体验如何启发闪耀洞窟的创作。","date":"2016-09-15","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン X・Yの作り方 第3回","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン X・Yの作り方 第3回","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7013851.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161006080749id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7013851.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり","ポケモン"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-7013851/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/001-87dc25fad9.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1127,845],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一回忆巴黎地下墓穴之旅，讲述这段恐惧又震撼的体验如何启发闪耀洞窟的创作。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">第3回\n\n「体验」\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n来到巴黎\n\n却有个地方\n\n即使去了巴黎\n\n也不太会去吧？\n\n这样的地方\n\n就是这里！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/001-87dc25fad9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/001-87dc25fad9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1127\" height=\"845\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真是一栋漆黑的建筑……\n\n<br>\n\n\n走近一看……\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/002-b9f384dd23.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/002-b9f384dd23.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1127\" height=\"845\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里是\n\n世界最大的地下墓地\n\n巴黎地下墓穴\n\n的入口\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n地下据说有\n\n多达600万人的\n\n遗骨……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n体验很重要！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所以\n\n我就去参观了！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n时间来到2010年10月22日\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/003-f6fc60b9f7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/003-f6fc60b9f7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"848\" height=\"633\"></a></figure>\n\n\n参观巴黎地下墓穴后的笔记\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n写下了参观时的压迫感和氛围\n\n以及伴随着恐惧\n\n对洞窟的感受\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为当时考虑要把\n\n《宝可梦 X·Y》做成\n\n3D作品\n\n所以这次体验\n\n给了我非常大的参考\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n参考了这座巴黎地下墓穴\n\n制作出的地方\n\n大家知道是哪里吗？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n没错……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n“闪耀洞窟”\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n把印象反转过来\n\n做成了既美丽又舒适\n\n但又显得狭窄\n\n在营造压迫感的同时\n\n打造出这座洞窟！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n各种各样的体验\n\n又会变化成\n\n全新的事物\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这也是\n\n制作事物时\n\n有趣的地方呢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附加内容）\n\n怕鬼的增田\n\n因为觉得既恐怖\n\n又有些不敬\n\n所以连内部的照片都没有拍！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因此\n\n可能不太容易传达出\n\n当时的印象\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n想了解详情的话\n\n请查看下面的网站！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n不过\n\n如果不擅长面对骨头和墓地\n\n我觉得还是不要看比较好……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n巴黎地下墓穴\n\n\n        官方网站\n↓\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.catacombes.paris.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.catacombes.paris.fr</a>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n详情介绍网站\n↓\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://dailynewsagency.com/2014/10/20/the-parisian-catacombs-the-worlds-5b5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://dailynewsagency.com/2014/10/20/the-parisian-catacombs-the-worlds-5b5/</a>\n<br>\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">第3回\n\n「体験」\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nパリに行っても\n\nなかなか行かないのでは？\n\nという場所が\n\nこちら！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/001-87dc25fad9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/001-87dc25fad9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1127\" height=\"845\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真っ黒な建物・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n寄ってみると・・\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/002-b9f384dd23.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/002-b9f384dd23.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1127\" height=\"845\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここは\n世界最大の地下墓地\n\nカタコンブ・ド・パリ\nの入口\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n地下には\n600万人もの\n遺骨があるそうです・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n経験は大切！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nということで\n行ってみました！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n時は2010年10月22日\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/003-f6fc60b9f7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7013851/003-f6fc60b9f7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"848\" height=\"633\"></a></figure>\n\n\nカタコンブを見学した後のメモ\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n見学時の圧迫感や空気感\nその恐怖とともに\n洞窟について\n書いています\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモンX・Yは\n3Dで作ろうと考えていたので\nこの体験が\nとても参考になりました\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこのカタコンブを参考にして\n作った場所分かりますか？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそう・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n「かがやきのどうくつ」\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nイメージを逆転させて\n美しく心地よく\nしかし狭い感じで\n圧迫感は出しつつ\n洞窟を作りました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいろいろな体験が\nまた新しいものに\n変化していく\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれも\nものづくりの\n面白いところですね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\nオバケが苦手なマスダは\n怖いのと不謹慎と思い\n内部の写真も撮ってません！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそのため\nイメージ伝わり辛いかも\n知れません\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n詳しく知りたい方は\n\n下記サイトをご覧ください！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nただし\n骨やお墓が苦手な方は\n見ない方が良いかと・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nカタコンブ・ド・パリ\n\n        オフィシャルHP\n↓\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.catacombes.paris.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.catacombes.paris.fr</a>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n詳しく書かれているサイト\n↓\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://dailynewsagency.com/2014/10/20/the-parisian-catacombs-the-worlds-5b5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://dailynewsagency.com/2014/10/20/the-parisian-catacombs-the-worlds-5b5/</a>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>"}}